# LF in every clone, whatever the platform; published agent run outputs are kept byte for byte.
* text=auto eol=lf
evals/results/**/runs/** -text
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.gif binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
# Fixture pages and their committed cue lists are byte-exact: a page's identity is its exact bytes, so Git never
# converts their line endings on any platform. The tests make CRLF copies at run time.
skills/legible-film/scripts/testpages/** -text
